From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:36:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] net: phy: as21xxx: support firmware 1.9.2 LED control

Replace direct LED-register programming with the firmware 1.9.2 SET_LED transaction. Cache phylib requests until config_init, serialize cache updates with mailbox access and use the vendor default five-LED configuration.

Based on Aeonsemi/MediaTek driver patch 743f5744388b88ba8bc0ae7912d4754438b29078 by Bo-Cun Chen and the OpenWrt adaptation in commit 80f610ddf0075cf896d1e9ccaa47c0f4aa26ef98 by Sean McCully. Reduced to the confirmed firmware 1.9.2 LED ABI and adapted to the typed IPC layer.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
 drivers/net/phy/as21xxx.c | 235 +++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 1 file changed, 141 insertions(+), 94 deletions(-)

